  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Chapter Agr 400 had formerly been titled “Stallion Registration” and contained rules governing registration of stallions. The former Chapter Agr 400 expired 10-22-90. The filings prior to the expiration of the former Chapter Agr 400 included the following documents:\n\n#2331, eff 3-31-83\n\n#2886, eff 10-22-84, EXPIRED 10-22-90",
